      "statement": "Every task's output is gated by .zerofactory/precommit.sh before a commit or PR: three phases in order (format: `ruff check --fix .` + `ruff format .` with pinned ruff auto-installed when missing; build: `python3 -m compileall -q .`; test: `python3 -m pytest tests/ -q` with a pinned pytest + plugin-runtime-deps stack auto-installed and no unittest fallback), exiting non-zero on first failure, and the dispatcher re-spawns zf-builder with the exact error output (up to 3 precommit retries) before work may become a PR.",
